<h3><strong>The NULL Semantics Pattern</strong></h3>
<p>When extending Automath, adopt its NULL trichotomy: <strong>semantic NULL</strong> (address not in protocol), <strong>protocol NULL</strong> (visible domain rejects), <strong>collision NULL</strong> (insufficient side-information). This prevents the common formalization error of conflating &quot;undefined&quot; with &quot;zero.&quot;</p>
<h3><strong>Performance Optimization</strong></h3>
<p>With 38,876 lines, build times matter. Use <code>lake build -Klean.pp.deepTerms=false</code> for faster compilation when debugging. The <code>IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md</code> documents which modules depend on heavy Mathlib imports.</p>
