<p>This isn't mysticism. It's <strong>mechanism</strong>. Every theorem in the 10,588-count is checkable. Every bridge to physics is traced. Every &quot;emergent&quot; structure has a derivation chain you can follow with <code>git blame</code> and <code>lake build</code>.</p>
<p>For developers, the lesson is profound: <strong>formal verification isn't just for bug-hunting anymore.</strong> It's a research methodology. The 16 AI agents, the knowledge graph, the publication pipeline—these are <strong>infrastructure for a new kind of science</strong> where human creativity directs and machines verify, but the boundary between conjecture and theorem becomes razor-thin.</p>
